clearsysmsg 
pause 250
random 6
pause 250
if insysmsg "Random: 1" 
    say "It Was Krypton That Made Me Superman, But It's The Earth That Makes Me Human." 44
elseif insysmsg "Random: 2"
    say "There's Always A Way. When The Odds Are Impossible -- Do The Impossible." 44
elseif insysmsg "Random: 3"
    say "If The Word 'Super' Is To Be Applied To Anyone, It Should Be Applied To All Of You, To All Mankind." 44 
elseif insysmsg "Random: 4"
    say "There is a superhero in all of us. We just need the courage to put on the cape." 44
elseif insysmsg "Random: 5"
    say "It's not about where you were born. Or what powers you have. Or what you wear on your chest. It's about what you do… It's about action" 44
elseif insysmsg "Random: 6"
    say "I'm here to fight for truth and justice." 44
endif

pause 120000
replay